{"strongs": "H0680", "word": "אָצַל", "translit": "a.tsal", "root": "אצל", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb denominative", "gloss": "lay aside, reserve, withdraw, withhold", "definition": "[ אָצַל ] verb denominative lay aside, reserve, withdraw, withhold — Qal Perfect אָצַלְתָּ Gen 27:36 אָצַלְתִּי Eccl 2:10 וְאָֽצַלְתִּ֫י consecutive Num 11:17 — reserve , לִי בְרָכָה Gen 27:36 ( withdraw ), set apart מִןהָֿרוּחַ Num 11:17 withhold מֵהֶם Eccl 2:10 . Niph`al Perfect נֶאֱצַל Ezek 42:6 be withdrawn , i.e. shortened or narrowed. Hiph`il Imperfect וַיָּאצֶל Num 11:25 ( Kö 1. 390 ) = Qal Num 11:17 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB695')\">BDB695</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H680')\">H680</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB694')\">BDB694</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB696')\">BDB696</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>אָצַל</bdbheb>] <b>verb denominative</b> <highlightword>lay aside, reserve, withdraw, withhold</highlightword> — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>אָצַלְתָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 27:36\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,36)\">Gen 27:36</ref> <bdbheb>אָצַלְתִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:10\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,10)\">Eccl 2:10</ref> <bdbheb>וְאָֽצַלְתִּ֫י</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Num 11:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,17)\">Num 11:17</ref> — <highlight>reserve</highlight>, <bdbheb>לִי בְרָכָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 27:36\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,36)\">Gen 27:36</ref> (<highlight>withdraw</highlight>), <highlight>set apart</highlight> <bdbheb>מִןהָֿרוּחַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 11:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,17)\">Num 11:17</ref> <highlight>withhold</highlight> <bdbheb>מֵהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:10\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,10)\">Eccl 2:10</ref>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>נֶאֱצַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 42:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,6)\">Ezek 42:6</ref> <highlight>be withdrawn</highlight>, i.e. <highlight>shortened</highlight> or <highlight>narrowed.</highlight> <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וַיָּאצֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 11:25\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,25)\">Num 11:25</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>1. 390</sup></lookup>) = Qal <ref ref=\"Num 11:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,17)\">Num 11:17</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 27:36", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 27, "verse": 36}, {"raw": "Eccl 2:10", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 2, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Num 11:17", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 11, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Ezek 42:6", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 42, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Num 11:25", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 11, "verse": 25}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אָצַל", "אָצַלְתָּ", "אָצַלְתִּי", "וְאָֽצַלְתִּ֫י", "לִי בְרָכָה", "מִןהָֿרוּחַ", "מֵהֶם", "נֶאֱצַל", "וַיָּאצֶל"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Kö"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB695", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}